<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detect Alignment</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Paladin (guild level 0), Healer (guild level 5), Necromancer (guild level 6), Druid (guild level 12)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast detect alignment &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast detect alignment</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target sees the alignment of people and 
things as an aura, wherever they are listed:
</p>
<ul><li>(blue): good</li>
<li>(red): evil</li>
<li>(green): neutral</li></ul>
<p>The better your detection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on 
potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Alignment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>